REQUIRED ATTRIBUTION FOR THIS DATASET

  When you use this data (in whole or in part, modified or unmodified),
  include a credit line such as:

    "Australian Car Repair Cost Dataset (2026), AutoRepairCost -
     https://autorepaircost.net/dataset-2026"

  together with a working hyperlink to https://autorepaircost.net
  (or https://autorepaircost.net/dataset-2026). If you modified the
  data, say so.

