DISCLAIMER

  The dataset contains aggregated, indicative market price ranges for
  Australian car repairs. It is provided "as is", without warranty of
  any kind, express or implied. Rows are estimates, not workshop
  quotes; verify high-stakes figures against the cited source pages
  before relying on them.